[31;1m# taiwan-ia-lab[0m
[31;1m[0m
[31;1m**Author: Brayann Benavides.** A living stock-forecasting lab for every common stock on TWSE and TPEx (Taiwan), run under a strict point-in-time clock and reviewed adversarially by an independent model. Analysis and simulated portfolios only: no real orders, no brokers, no credentials.[0m
[31;1m[0m
[31;1m- **Website (Spanish · English · 繁體中文):** https://brayannbegu11.github.io/stock/ — published from the `gh-pages` branch by `scripts/deploy_pages.py`; the source is `docs/index.html` on `main`, with its data embedded by `scripts/export_site_data.py`, so the page also opens directly from disk.[0m
[31;1m- Specification received (GPT-6 Pro, v2.0, 9 Sep 2026): `docs/spec/v2/`[0m
[31;1m- Builder's reports (Spanish): `docs/informes/`[0m
[31;1m- Independent review rounds (GPT-6 Astra via Codex CLI): `review/out/`[0m
[31;1m[0m
[31;1m## Getting started[0m
[31;1m[0m
[31;1m```bash[0m
[31;1mpython -m pip install -e ".[dev,model]"[0m
[31;1mpython -m pytest -q -p no:cacheprovider            # acceptance tests, no network (count: python -m pytest --co -q)[0m
[31;1mpython scripts/capture_daily.py                    # daily capture to data/raw (TWSE/TPEx OpenAPI + FinMind), real ingested_at[0m
[31;1mpython scripts/build_master.py                     # SCD2 security master and census -> data/store, docs/informes/10_censo_<date>.md[0m
[31;1mpython scripts/fetch_history_sample.py             # stratified census sample with FinMind bars and dividends (network, ~5 min)[0m
[31;1mpython scripts/fetch_universe_daily.py --start 2024-07-01   # official per-date quotes for the whole market (network, ~2 h; resumable; no dividends)[0m
[31;1mpython scripts/run_q0_demo.py --start 2024-01-01 --end 2025-12-31          # end-to-end demo (no network)[0m
[31;1mpython scripts/run_backtest.py --manifest sample --start 2024-01-01 --end 2025-12-31 --forecasters Q0,Q1,A1[0m
[31;1mpython scripts/run_backtest.py --manifest daily --lookback-start 2024-07-01 --start 2026-05-04 --end 2026-09-09 --forecasters Q0,Q1,A1 --min-train-weeks 40 --report 15_backtest_universo_2026.md[0m
[31;1mpython scripts/run_backtest.py --manifest daily --lookback-start 2024-07-01 --start 2026-05-04 --end 2026-09-09 --forecasters Q0,Q1,A1 --min-train-weeks 40 --notional 15000 --lot-size 1 --min-commission 20 --slippage-bps 20 --label user_75kTWD_oddlots_2026 --report 15b_backtest_universo_2026_lotes_sueltos.md[0m
